"m-f67217b8-d78d-4a26-b8d5-969e8fa43328" ulx="478" uly="1448" lrx="913" lry="1474" /><zone xml:id="m-29e2a0d4-c089-4c8e-94ff-4931b9cf8ad6" ulx="33" uly="1469" lrx="466" lry="1504" /><zone xml:id="m-6278a896-7c21-492d-b717-44b5f830aaf9" ulx="479" uly="1470" lrx="913" lry="1502" /><zone xml:id="m-cab98ed9-7641-41a4-b4c8-1c23f091041b" ulx="34" uly="1499" lrx="893" lry="1533" /><zone xml:id="m-04da25ea-6b5a-423f-8fb4-db358b5e812e" ulx="61" uly="1531" lrx="327" lry="1564" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-544c7255-8638-4408-9fd8-4f03b803091c" n="1979" facs="#m-7d90d81f-f60f-4d84-9a3f-d83465a14811" /><div xml:id="m-cccab899-1ced-4043-9f8e-fcbfc78d131e">
            <lg xml:id="m-48dcb388-dddb-40d4-9247-2767dfffb2ee">
              <l xml:id="m-97c19346-4498-4b99-afa0-06fab3016b95" facs="#m-cfe1bf44-ba8e-4595-b64b-c58e44eb39c2" label="ambiguous">November 2.</l><l xml:id="m-aa71bc70-eb0f-4e02-ae9d-7f90581c0b22" facs="#m-7640328e-ac27-4558-807a-c82b62a852ea" label="ambiguous">1733</l><l xml:id="m-1f7a3222-f832-4b9c-8715-0e9d61b35d8e" facs="#m-929d9ee0-76c6-42bd-a11f-12bc235db733" label="lyrics-like">tu, qui solus es? Breves dies hómi-l Recéde páululum ab eo, ut quiéscat,</l><l xml:id="m-6c23cbbb-e102-480a-9aed-847694128296" facs="#m-edbbda5d-25b4-4e25-8f93-67a1b8dd8c81" label="lyrics-like">nis sunt, númerus ménsium ejus</l><l xml:id="m-f4e921af-c425-40e5-9f32-1822ad38e7ba" facs="#m-af1adca6-f9d3-46fb-b6c1-c638ec999c0a" label="lyrics-like">donec optáta véniat, sicut merce¬</l><l xml:id="m-150d30ec-7ebd-4725-b344-09ebeee68cae" facs="#m-789ba71f-dddf-4970-b92b-d88664482f2a" label="lyrics-like">apud te est: constituísti términos</l><l xml:id="m-df2fd668-e31e-4378-b564-cc8cc24d925f" facs="#m-eaf81283-57ac-4cfc-b51b-0e1b7ec41e31" label="lyrics-like">nárii, dies ejus.</l><l xml:id="m-54e41bfd-f5a2-4df5-aa92-c275dc5e0fb0" facs="#m-d6056528-73fd-4e87-801a-343a177b7982" label="lyrics-like">ejus, quí praeteríri non póterunt.</l><l xml:id="m-0836f8bd-c21f-4672-b4cf-06018d3c48ba" facs="#m-dfd9e187-2cac-4cb0-9ffd-d8d0c0c4ddd1" label="lyrics-like">R. Qui Lázarum. D. 1786.</l><l xml:id="m-4f6d7c5d-a8a5-47ce-8841-4cb33ac27b0e" facs="#m-068c29a5-baeb-4ad5-b6ff-3ebea380daf7" label="ambiguous">Lesson III.</l><l xml:id="m-19b157c0-dedb-43cb-acb2-52d627ec0dc2" facs="#m-cf574806-d181-48a8-828b-1c02a6413285" label="ambiguous">Job 19, 20-27.</l><l xml:id="m-3dc4c6d9-cc7e-4667-b141-604e5e3d6863" facs="#m-f02cde6c-dc15-4ba2-b2ec-2d14ff451e87" label="lyrics-like">OElli meae, consúmptis cárnibus,</l><l xml:id="m-cf7ca23a-efcc-400f-8be5-731f0846e760" facs="#m-ce83171b-f5fd-44ce-8358-f1c0d74a926a" label="lyrics-like">stvlo férreo, et plumbi lámina, vel</l><l xml:id="m-5b5bb531-7a82-4a1b-a9cb-849dd15da51e" facs="#m-990a5777-873a-47cd-85e6-5bcc56983786" label="lyrics-like">adhaésit os meum, et derelicta</l><l xml:id="m-b67eb9cc-2a1b-48e0-94de-8897a0eb270a" facs="#m-be1cbe99-df62-48f1-9d42-674d031b98ee" label="lyrics-like">celte sculpántur in sílice? Scio enim</l><l xml:id="m-3ee8e38d-d361-4716-88e6-ef016de3fb36" facs="#m-6ad3b464-393c-4294-97d7-a5e585307fbb" label="lyrics-like">quod Redémptor meus vivit, et in</l><l xml:id="m-4f1aaf50-a0a8-4efb-8b5e-9646ee55561d" facs="#m-ca9f837f-4b74-4cd0-a980-920682e0c304" label="lyrics-like">sunt tantúmmodo lábia circa dentes</l><l xml:id="m-f0c71040-7544-4bb8-84fe-11cbe6896061" facs="#m-ff01e02a-e151-4000-9ccd-a5116cd0ceaf" label="lyrics-like">meos. Miserémini mei, miserémini</l><l xml:id="m-00cc3aec-148e-4f30-bf9f-587edac949e9" facs="#m-f1e8d3f6-7b9a-4380-9a56-46e6dc560dc6" label="lyrics-like">novíssimo die de terra surrectúrus</l><l xml:id="m-692d927b-dbcc-4aeb-b353-1943151b4978" facs="#m-53afbf22-d016-453e-8e9c-967b11adffbd" label="ambiguous">mei, saltem vos, amici mei, quia</l><l xml:id="m-d6b900a4-a093-429c-a9c7-9f471781a846" facs="#m-30624311-2c49-4dfd-bde9-f482bba90eed" label="lyrics-like">sum : et rursum circúmdabor pelle</l><l xml:id="m-9d759a47-5d13-4b86-974a-06086a7845be" facs="#m-4bae69d9-4cb1-41dd-be19-72c5c56da6c9" label="lyrics-like">manus Dómini tétigit me. Quare</l><l xml:id="m-8cc86916-e4c4-43a7-8a3c-83fb9879021f" facs="#m-1ee47cca-3a49-403a-9da6-b6ffebf8bd1b" label="lyrics-like">mea, et in carne mea vidébo Deum</l><l xml:id="m-dab065f6-903e-480b-9db4-9e258f6db481" facs="#m-b9791d77-9df5-434d-92de-b717be22880e" label="lyrics-like">persequímini me sicut Deus, et car¬</l><l xml:id="m-3738eafb-312d-468c-8d83-9b251de1cb03" facs="#m-edf26a23-0d22-4670-a5fc-9171a588e8c6" label="lyrics-like">meum. Quem visúrus sum ego ipse,</l><l xml:id="m-b3010067-fb6b-4c2b-a23e-4c5e6e5a0b47" facs="#m-955c32f3-1f8c-4424-a3cb-cd21e31ed577" label="lyrics-like">nibus meis saturámini? Quis mihi</l><l xml:id="m-05f7b93f-424a-43ec-83f7-6179602520b1" facs="#m-e6ca01c1-3bd1-4f69-bf0e-728f3128d0ad" label="lyrics-like">et óculi mei conspectúri sunt, et non</l><l xml:id="m-b77d2631-2491-4f53-b153-832173639cc3" facs="#m-41ef5569-4cca-4357-aa98-11c5b7e902c8" label="lyrics-like">tribuat ut scribántur sermónes mei?</l><l xml:id="m-c08bb681-e95d-42e2-add0-cb54d103f273" facs="#m-b94ab887-94df-484d-9a12-2771c6a7d29d" label="lyrics-like">álius : repósita est haec spes mea in</l><l xml:id="m-ede460e8-e5c7-49e5-a811-8ed6e4bb3b7a" facs="#m-d4e7ea90-8062-44fb-b29a-c49aed9840b6" label="lyrics-like">quis mihi det ut exaréntur in libro! sinu meo.</l><l xml:id="m-d7bf0573-e447-45b7-b23d-e12562803203" facs="#m-8af8e998-0f24-43a4-8421-1ba542cb3bb7" label="lyrics-like">E. Dómine. p. 17</l><l xml:id="m-782b930e-d1c7-4d01-8087-f1c8313e66ea" facs="#m-2ce2a3d4-b92e-4a77-b4dc-ad3706026f33" label="text-like">IN THE SECOND NOCTURN.</l><l xml:id="m-3b8fa615-8721-4f70-8f94-f72118b0c799" facs="#m-4bafdefa-6e7e-4c0c-851d-3e4909b9156c" label="ambiguous">Lesson IV.</l><l xml:id="m-6562370b-9f79-405e-a128-db787c0ca902" facs="#m-77c75d65-1215-409c-bd08-5c18b69602ce" label="ambiguous">Cap. 2 et 3.</l><l xml:id="m-ff317a0c-232b-41b4-9c30-90b73dd3dd06" facs="#m-4fd0c712-2905-41de-a978-7faa21ddd4a2" label="lyrics-like">Ex libro sancti Augustini Episcopi! major afféctus; nullo modo ipsa</l><l xml:id="m-1672249b-8f13-4ed1-b44d-da0bab063663" facs="#m-6a24b9cb-45c7-4678-bed6-b25e0b431b0a" label="lyrics-like">spernénda sunt córpora, quae úti¬</l><l xml:id="m-fa1bf83b-872d-4d05-aed6-7f78d0db2f21" facs="#m-8941e711-787d-4872-90f2-b0914b9a6595" label="lyrics-like">de Cura pro mórtuis gerénda.</l><l xml:id="m-dafd572d-e8f0-4e69-b28b-596ff84e2eaa" facs="#m-e6432e7d-c594-4b95-a09c-31c42465dbdd" label="lyrics-like">que multo familiárius atque con¬</l><l xml:id="m-2d597822-422b-4363-9c7d-3ad72e984b30" facs="#m-9c232732-c1a6-402e-a185-13e4ebbced42" label="lyrics-like">NUrátio fúneris, conditio sepul¬</l><l xml:id="m-405651ec-56f5-4dbc-abba-a5b8a7c14e17" facs="#m-82ff6fea-86fd-4e42-a30d-3e821c3efbcf" label="lyrics-like">junctius quam quaélibet indumén¬</l><l xml:id="m-2c3e9ef3-1dbc-4d34-a986-5e62fda879f3" facs="#m-0ffe40f6-0a06-49c6-97eb-31135383f90f" label="lyrics-like">L túrae, pompa exsequiárum, ma¬</l><l xml:id="m-a3d6a502-80af-4c08-84cd-b515680465fa" facs="#m-d9dd85a9-7af0-4bf2-b795-55bf65a29b0b" label="lyrics-like">ta gestámus. Haec enim non ad</l><l xml:id="m-71ab25fc-d5ae-44e2-9c4a-eb914792fa5c" facs="#m-06107b87-8eea-4ce2-9623-fc7e82fdd64f" label="lyrics-like">gis sunt vivórum solatia, quam</l><l xml:id="m-ffe035f4-9b04-47ae-b078-d77dc2e9549a" facs="#m-6a29a9b8-4428-4838-b46e-38502dfcf281" label="lyrics-like">ornãméntum vel adjutórium, quod</l><l xml:id="m-8630a2ea-eec8-4a51-b2e0-ce633c2c790a" facs="#m-8b9d1693-f8b0-4e2d-acee-e7b1c1be937c" label="lyrics-like">subsídia mortuórum. Nec ídeo ta¬</l><l xml:id="m-8ac861d1-cc2c-45e8-85bf-fd1f47847719" facs="#m-48446cb7-0da9-42f8-8db3-c080d391a5d9" label="lyrics-like">adhibétur extrinsecus, sed ad ipsam</l><l xml:id="m-d8f416ae-5bbf-4688-b0ee-780e94c06531" facs="#m-732e64da-ed6d-4015-b465-a9a79a6caf77" label="lyrics-like">men contemnénda et abiiciénda</l><l xml:id="m-39229320-bf0d-41ee-b44b-18b3c7292b9d" facs="#m-92c40746-842b-458a-8667-fbd6a2e11f30" label="lyrics-like">natúram hóminis pértinent. Unde</l><l xml:id="m-bdcfbb48-f1c5-4adc-aa46-55dcfc6cc436" facs="#m-9d5e4db4-520b-41cc-86dd-59cc432619ce" label="lyrics-like">sunt córpora defunctórum maximé¬</l><l xml:id="m-1bbc67f2-d631-4e60-88b0-19809210dbea" facs="#m-29f09f30-6f73-4bbe-af81-1bf9d032c898" label="lyrics-like">et antiquérum justórum fúnera</l><l xml:id="m-af546830-ab18-49c3-9f82-cd6b8e53e98c" facs="#m-8b270ac8-c44d-4fca-8418-ce64907c32c6" label="lyrics-like">que justórum ac fidélium, quibus</l><l xml:id="m-e62ac82f-2e5c-4b74-9e20-1b01367f7e28" facs="#m-b6b72fd0-f1f3-448b-9b19-ea6c39b6516f" label="lyrics-like">officiósa pietá̂te curáta sunt, et</l><l xml:id="m-86053f48-eb6d-41e6-add8-c5617201babd" facs="#m-08d4c6b8-c603-4071-9dd2-4992921c8935" label="lyrics-like">tamquam órganis et vasis ad ómnia</l><l xml:id="m-c1daa1e0-3d8d-4cd0-b3e5-620a93cd48fd" facs="#m-8de26abb-ef49-4c88-8a59-063b3b282c45" label="lyrics-like">exséquiae celebrátae, et sepultúra</l><l xml:id="m-eb94a31e-7c20-41ac-983b-7387c66777fd" facs="#m-0a9543f9-3456-4701-bd9c-1a4771782669" label="lyrics-like">bona ópera sancte usus est spíritus.</l><l xml:id="m-dfa85d3d-a87e-4173-ae39-45835252c68e" facs="#m-ca9fecdc-25b9-42fc-bfe1-799cb691a1f6" label="lyrics-like">provísa : ipsique, cum viverent, de</l><l xml:id="m-1d35d3c6-e57b-4d06-be1a-335c2347a44c" facs="#m-72aad182-83fa-46ca-bea3-713583bce3d9" label="lyrics-like">si enim patérna vestis et ánnulus,</l><l xml:id="m-78fdae97-dc3f-4a93-97c7-c9e04636c912" facs="#m-949810a4-0946-41fa-998c-12ddc37ac1e5" label="lyrics-like">sepeliéndis vel étiam transferéndis</l><l xml:id="m-ce612b3b-f873-4dc9-986c-2b91e651d875" facs="#m-fa023cf2-d475-47e1-9f35-b6cf881c0766" label="lyrics-like">ac si quid hujúsmodi, tanto cárius</l><l xml:id="m-ff4c6013-4fc5-463a-9cb3-363ec7aac1e6" facs="#m-4981fc34-ad0c-4c82-9f2e-acdf674b9770" label="lyrics-like">suis corpóribus filiis mandavérunt.</l><l xml:id="m-0b94ca34-b989-4228-bf0e-e750f74481a0" facs="#m-78cf5181-38c2-4dc8-b79f-866286d8be94" label="lyrics-like">est pósteris, quanto erga paréntes</l><l xml:id="m-d13d7e8a-7ac9-480b-bdc7-018c331fa871" facs="#m-44e26b9e-94d1-48c0-9995-437a94bc4514" label="lyrics-like">K. Meménto méi. p. 1791.</l><l xml:id="m-fa3d3181-86a9-4662-96c9-61442d1ca0a5" facs="#m-a8299058-93d1-4d60-bca0-4cc367e6f8c9" label="ambiguous">Lesson V.</l><l xml:id="m-79e50e5e-44a8-4e8c-8927-1627663263a9" facs="#m-60be10a9-e86d-4752-8e8b-ee84bf4e2665" label="ambiguous">Cap. 4.</l><l xml:id="m-d3a83c73-6c0e-4675-8382-e9743a3bf494" facs="#m-460ed647-99f5-4646-983c-ffe22ddf7524" label="lyrics-like">O Ecordantis et precántis afféctus et cathólica societáte defúnctis</l><l xml:id="m-f1eae847-c008-4c77-99bf-5ee49b984ade" facs="#m-2f2984f5-7d01-4d59-a8f5-98912444ae1a" label="lyrics-like">I cum defúnctis a fidélibus caris¬</l><l xml:id="m-d6b388b7-ccf7-4b5b-8039-d6bd7f620788" facs="#m-4a54aed4-81fa-4c17-98e2-75c21569a794" label="lyrics-like">étiam tácitis eórum nominibus, sub</l><l xml:id="m-3464dcf6-122c-4ca5-9608-798e08a0a5e7" facs="#m-ef577031-3fbc-4c5c-bda1-ffaf0557a1b3" label="lyrics-like">simis exhibétur, eum prodésse non</l><l xml:id="m-126e0943-e726-460d-b938-f6d5cca8e3b5" facs="#m-61ab39f6-8242-4d41-9f67-8e7a491c1283" label="lyrics-like">generáli commemoratióne suscépit</l><l xml:id="m-ea080285-f801-4572-bdc7-bc404ad539ad" facs="#m-c15513b9-5260-4dc4-b262-30ffc8e19332" label="lyrics-like">Écclésia; ut quibus ad ista desunt</l><l xml:id="m-b9c2e601-eebe-4042-847a-d69c8ec909c4" facs="#m-2b866928-02a0-462a-8648-bcb0e95395d5" label="lyrics-like">dúbium est iis, qui cum in córpore</l><l xml:id="m-ba3f2cf0-f609-49b9-b275-a5b9c41fdc70" facs="#m-590ef248-8283-4a56-a3b3-91b2a6b39a54" label="lyrics-like">víverent, tália sibi post hanc vitam</l><l xml:id="m-69902bf2-ba81-4050-b244-65911bb82708" facs="#m-6b983c4e-25ba-4c53-badf-8d8af61e8cbe" label="lyrics-like">paréntes, aut filii, aut quicúmque co¬</l><l xml:id="m-d9156e94-dd97-48ac-8b64-1d1511e55355" facs="#m-7f459d35-4c72-4293-a9be-9c906ffaacbb" label="lyrics-like">gnáti vel amíci, ab una eis exhibeán¬</l><l xml:id="m-60cca83c-3bb8-495d-81c4-4dcbcaa9852a" facs="#m-213f5610-be3f-4c52-8aa9-f6ab099383e0" label="lyrics-like">prodésse meruérunt. Verum, etsi</l><l xml:id="m-6e89484c-c69a-495f-bb29-023311025a7f" facs="#m-a4778009-1466-4d28-92a8-5f346db1303d" label="lyrics-like">áliqua necéssitas vel humári cór¬</l><l xml:id="m-c5dcefc0-3b0f-4a20-b60b-6e5e3564f8f1" facs="#m-3d44f532-397c-4ed6-bcd9-d3606b3f8c37" label="lyrics-like">tur pia matre commúni. Si autem</l><l xml:id="m-ee1296fc-4753-414f-af5e-08b36a3a6481" facs="#m-8476c049-1662-435c-b4b6-12a5ca040af5" label="lyrics-like">pora, vel in sacris locis humári</l><l xml:id="m-76d3e755-6948-48af-a87d-74433209a153" facs="#m-43ca5d44-18a4-4fe3-9ec8-535b348ee1c6" label="lyrics-like">deéssent istae supplicatiónes, quae</l><l xml:id="m-8de7a0c5-08f1-450d-af15-bcfa30f15a91" facs="#m-e08dd62b-b4d9-48f8-882c-268a4dee55fb" label="lyrics-like">nulla data facultáte permittat, non</l><l xml:id="m-c3a45c8e-d947-41ec-a86c-b083254abe14" facs="#m-84e15d4a-9bab-4687-a426-ca60871737b6" label="lyrics-like">fiunt recta fide ac pietâte pro mór¬</l><l xml:id="m-3ce609e8-348a-466b-8236-139c58bd9bf9" facs="#m-f1310312-b59f-43cc-ac52-991be57366e3" label="lyrics-like">sunt praetermitténdae supplicatió¬</l><l xml:id="m-29be6cc5-1067-4806-8620-d3635feafe0a" facs="#m-f67217b8-d78d-4a26-b8d5-969e8fa43328" label="lyrics-like">tuis, puto quod nihil prodésset spirí¬</l><l xml:id="m-26de7216-471c-48e5-850e-89cb65508e7b" facs="#m-29e2a0d4-c089-4c8e-94ff-4931b9cf8ad6" label="lyrics-like">nes pro spirítibus mortuórum : quas</l><l xml:id="m-c96a0d56-e8ce-4cc6-b619-34048827e82a" facs="#m-6278a896-7c21-492d-b717-44b5f830aaf9" label="lyrics-like">tibus eórum, quámlibet in locis san¬</l><l xml:id="m-9473e94e-d6ae-4a5b-a407-2e2c4bf86df0" facs="#m-cab98ed9-7641-41a4-b4c8-1c23f091041b" label="lyrics-like">faciéndas pro ómnibus in christiána! ctis exánima córpora poneréntur.</l><l xml:id="m-cb0c4679-6868-4755-bf0a-1a0d34e2a757" facs="#m-04da25ea-6b5a-423f-8fb4-db358b5e812e" label="lyrics-like">K. Hei míhi. p. 1791.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>